00:00:21.393 --> 00:00:26.500
then AI starts using us and that should be the other way around

00:00:26.767 --> 00:00:30.767
it taught me how to make the threads pretty well that's pretty good it's

00:00:30.467 --> 00:00:35.213
funny how bad AI's spatial reasoning is it really has no concept of like

00:00:34.913 --> 00:00:38.567
3D space at all — it makes sense because it's just an algorithm

00:00:38.807 --> 00:00:41.007
AI is not our equal.

00:00:41.067 --> 00:00:41.607
No.

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:44.033
It is our tool.

00:00:44.293 --> 00:00:47.713
is it telling me what to do or am I telling it what to do you know is it

00:00:47.413 --> 00:00:49.267
acting upon me or am I acting upon it because
